{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42234","headline":"和张先辈见寄二首 二 · 徐铉","name":"和张先辈见寄二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清时沦放在山州，邛竹纱巾处处游。\n野日苍茫悲鵩舍，水风阴湿弊貂裘。\n鸡鸣候旦宁辞晦，松节凌霜几换秋。\n两首新诗千里道，感君情分独知丘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}